<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s319S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w3">Virtue</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w2">taken in</span> by the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w1">realm of desire</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w12">represents</span> a type of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w11">deed</span> which is both <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w4">white</span> and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w5">black</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w6">and</span> which <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w8">also</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w7">ripens</span> into something both <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w9">white</span> and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w10">black</span>. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w16">Since</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s319w13">its</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w14">basic nature</span> is <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s319w15">free of affliction</span> it is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w17">white</span> but--<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w24">since</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w20">within</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w19">single</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w18">mental stream</span> it is also <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w23">mixed</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w22">with</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w21">afflicted things</span>--it is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w25">black</span> as well. It <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w30">ripens</span> into something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w31">white</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w29">because</span> it <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w28">gives forth</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w27">pleasant</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w26">result</span> but--<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w38">since</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w34">within</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w33">particular</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w32">mental stream</span> this is also <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w37">mixed</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s319w36">with</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w35">suffering</span>--we can also say it <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w39">ripens</span> into something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s319w40">black</span>.</span>
